<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href=" jbrawner.castlecookemortgage.com"><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in John Brawners's contact info</font>&nbsp;</a></b>below and complete the application. John's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><img width="153" height="147" src="https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ui=2&amp;ik=68ae21f3e1&amp;view=fimg&amp;th=15e8132a0aafb12d&amp;attid=0.0.2&amp;disp=emb&amp;realattid=70c32b7df5143caf_0.2&amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-T2jTTKwBfRdNvKsAJaSy5PQXVu_w6mC2xcno3fJNsX5BH-rJFXxJTBe0m3nleyaZXIw7OM40WK4VOJ7cakujttajpIcezss3NT_K_PTd7soSSoyydjUqNaog&amp;sz=w306-h294&amp;ats=1505765752597&amp;rm=15e8132a0aafb12d&amp;zw&amp;atsh=1" align="left" hspace="12" alt="John_Brawner" class="m_7179581169276933867gmail-m_228